<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Disolucions</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- KaTeX para renderizado matemático impecable de factores de conversión -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/katex@0.16.9/dist/katex.min.css">
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/katex@0.16.9/dist/katex.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/katex@0.16.9/dist/contrib/auto-render.min.js"></script>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f6fb;
            color: #1e293b;
        }
        .font-mono-num {
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        }
        .pill-shadow {
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px -2px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05), 0 1px 3px 0 rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.03);
        }
        .katex-display {
            margin: 0.75em 0 !important;
            overflow-x: auto;
            overflow-y: hidden;
            padding: 0.25rem 0;
        }
        @keyframes popIn {
            0% { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px) scale(0.99); }
            100% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1); }
        }
        .animate-pop {
            animation: popIn 0.28s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;
        }
        /* Transición suave de escala y color para el matraz aforado SVG */
        .flask-svg-wrapper {
            transition: transform 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
            transform-origin: bottom center;
        }
        .flask-liquid-path {
            transition: fill 0.35s ease, fill-opacity 0.35s ease;
        }
        /* Estilo de unidad tachada en el constructor de factores */
        .unit-cancelled {
            position: relative;
            display: inline-block;
            opacity: 0.55;
        }
        .unit-cancelled::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            left: -3px;
            right: -3px;
            top: 50%;
            height: 2.2px;
            background-color: #e11d48;
            transform: rotate(-14deg);
            border-radius: 2px;
        }
        .factor-card {
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        .factor-card:hover:not(:disabled) {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 14px -3px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.18);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between p-3 sm:p-6 md:p-8">

    <div class="max-w-5xl w-full mx-auto space-y-4">

        <!-- 1. TOP HEADER BAR (Idéntica a la captura 1) -->
        <header class="bg-white rounded-2xl pill-shadow border border-slate-100 px-5 py-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <!-- Left: Icon & Title -->
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3.5">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#4f46e5] flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow-md shadow-indigo-200 shrink-0">
                    <!-- Icono Matraz / Átomo -->
                    <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.75 3.104v5.714a2.25 2.25 0 01-.659 1.591L5 14.5M9.75 3.104c-.251.023-.501.05-.75.082m.75-.082a24.301 24.301 0 014.5 0m0 0v5.714c0 .597.237 1.17.659 1.591L19.8 15.3M14.25 3.104c.251.023.501.05.75.082M19.8 15.3l-1.57.393A9.065 9.065 0 0112 15a9.065 9.065 0 00-6.23-.693L5 14.5m14.8.8l1.402 1.402c1.232 1.232.65 3.318-1.067 3.611A48.309 48.309 0 0112 21c-2.773 0-5.491-.235-8.135-.687-1.718-.293-2.3-2.379-1.067-3.61L5 14.5" />
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h1 id="app-title" class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#1e1b4b] tracking-tight leading-tight">Disolver</h1>
                    <p id="app-subtitle" class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 font-medium">Elena Ruiz Alfaro</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Right: Language Switch & Score Pills -->
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5">
                <!-- Selector Idioma -->
                <div class="bg-slate-100 p-1 rounded-full flex items-center border border-slate-200/80 text-xs font-bold">
                    <button id="btn-lang-ca" onclick="setLanguage('ca')" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full transition-all text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800">
                        Català
                    </button>
                    <button id="btn-lang-es" onclick="setLanguage('es')" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full transition-all bg-white text-[#4f46e5] shadow-sm">
                        Castellano
                    </button>
                </div>

                <!-- Pill ACIERTOS -->
                <div class="bg-[#eff6ff] border border-blue-200/70 text-[#1d4ed8] px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-extrabold tracking-wide uppercase">
                    <span id="lbl-hits">ACIERTOS:</span> <span id="stat-hits" class="font-mono-num ml-0.5">0</span>
                </div>

                <!-- Pill RÉCORD -->
                <div class="bg-[#fefce8] border border-amber-200/70 text-[#b45309] px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-extrabold tracking-wide uppercase">
                    <span id="lbl-record">RÉCORD:</span> <span id="stat-record" class="font-mono-num ml-0.5">0</span>
                </div>

                <!-- Pill RACHA -->
                <div class="bg-[#4f46e5] text-white px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-extrabold tracking-wide uppercase shadow-sm shadow-indigo-300 flex items-center gap-1">
                    <span>🔥</span> <span id="lbl-streak">RACHA:</span> <span id="stat-streak" class="font-mono-num">0</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </header>

        <!-- 2. CENTER TIMER PILL (Idéntica a la captura 1) -->
        <div class="flex justify-center my-1">
            <div class="bg-white rounded-full pill-shadow border border-slate-100 px-5 py-2 flex items-center gap-3">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v6h4.5m4.5 0a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                </svg>
                <span id="lbl-time" class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 tracking-wider uppercase">TIEMPO:</span>
                <span id="timer-display" class="font-mono-num text-base font-extrabold text-[#1e1b4b]">00:00</span>
                <button onclick="toggleTimer()" id="btn-timer-toggle" title="Pausar / Reanudar" class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 flex items-center justify-center transition text-xs font-bold">
                    ⏸
                </button>
                <button onclick="resetTimer()" title="Reiniciar tiempo" class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 flex items-center justify-center transition text-xs font-bold">
                    ↺
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 3. STUDENT & SESSION BAR (Idéntica a la captura 1) -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl pill-shadow border border-slate-100 px-5 py-3.5 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
            <!-- Input Alumno/a -->
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 flex-grow sm:flex-grow-0">
                <span class="text-slate-500 text-sm">👤</span>
                <label id="lbl-student" for="student-name" class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 whitespace-nowrap">Alumno/a:</label>
                <input id="student-name" type="text" placeholder="Ej. Ana García" class="border border-slate-200 rounded-xl px-3.5 py-1.5 text-sm text-slate-800 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 w-full sm:w-64 bg-slate-50/50">
            </div>

            <!-- Contadores por categoría y botón PDF -->
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
                <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600">
                    <span id="lbl-cat1-pill">Molaridad:</span> <span id="stat-cat-conc" class="font-bold text-[#4f46e5]">0</span>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600">
                    <span id="lbl-cat-mass-pill">% y g/L:</span> <span id="stat-cat-mass" class="font-bold text-[#4f46e5]">0</span>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600">
                    <span id="lbl-cat-chi-pill">Fracc. Molar:</span> <span id="stat-cat-chi" class="font-bold text-[#4f46e5]">0</span>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600">
                    <span id="lbl-cat2-pill">Riqueza y ρ:</span> <span id="stat-cat-com" class="font-bold text-[#4f46e5]">0</span>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600">
                    <span id="lbl-cat3-pill">Diluciones:</span> <span id="stat-cat-dil" class="font-bold text-[#4f46e5]">0</span>
                </div>

                <button onclick="generateSessionPDF()" class="bg-[#059669] hover:bg-[#047857] text-white font-bold text-xs px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl shadow-sm transition flex items-center gap-1.5 ml-1">
                    <span>📄</span> <span id="lbl-pdf-btn">Generar PDF de Sesión</span>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 4. NAVIGATION TABS -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 pt-1">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                <button onclick="switchMainTab('practice')" id="tab-practice" class="px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm transition-all bg-[#4f46e5] text-white shadow-sm flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span>🧮</span> <span id="lbl-tab-practice">Entrenador de Problemas</span>
                </button>
                <button onclick="switchMainTab('lab')" id="tab-lab" class="px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm transition-all bg-white text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200/80 flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span>🧪</span> <span id="lbl-tab-lab">Simulador de Matraz Aforado</span>
                </button>
                <button onclick="switchMainTab('theory')" id="tab-theory" class="px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm transition-all bg-white text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200/80 flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span>📖</span> <span id="lbl-tab-theory">Apuntes y Formulario (BAT_FQ 2.1)</span>
                </button>
            </div>

            <!-- Filtro de categoría (visible en Entrenador) -->
            <div id="category-filter-box" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 bg-white p-1 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/80 text-xs font-semibold">
                <button onclick="setProblemCategory('all')" id="cat-btn-all" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-indigo-50 text-[#4f46e5] font-bold transition">Todos</button>
                <button onclick="setProblemCategory('conc')" id="cat-btn-conc" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100 transition">Molaridad</button>
                <button onclick="setProblemCategory('mass')" id="cat-btn-mass" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100 transition">% y g/L</button>
                <button onclick="setProblemCategory('chi')" id="cat-btn-chi" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100 transition">Fracción Molar</button>
                <button onclick="setProblemCategory('com')" id="cat-btn-com" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100 transition">Riqueza y ρ</button>
                <button onclick="setProblemCategory('dil')" id="cat-btn-dil" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100 transition">Diluciones</button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ===================================================== -->
        <!-- SECTION A: ENTRENADOR DE PROBLEMAS (2 MODALIDADES)    -->
        <!-- ===================================================== -->
        <section id="sec-practice" class="bg-white rounded-3xl pill-shadow border border-slate-100 p-6 sm:p-8 animate-pop">
            <!-- Selector de Modalidad: Ejercicio Completo vs Problema Guiado -->
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pb-4 mb-5 border-b border-slate-100">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span id="lbl-mode-select" class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">Modalidad:</span>
                    <div class="bg-slate-100 p-1 rounded-xl flex items-center border border-slate-200/80 text-xs font-bold">
                        <button id="btn-mode-direct" onclick="setPracticeMode('direct')" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg transition-all bg-white text-[#4f46e5] shadow-sm flex items-center gap-1.5">
                            <span>⚡</span> <span id="lbl-mode-direct">Ejercicio Completo (Directo)</span>
                        </button>
                        <button id="btn-mode-guided" onclick="setPracticeMode('guided')" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg transition-all text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                            <span>🧩</span> <span id="lbl-mode-guided">Problema Guiado (Factores paso a paso)</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span id="q-number-badge" class="bg-indigo-100 text-[#4f46e5] font-mono-num text-xs font-extrabold px-3 py-1 rounded-full">#1</span>
                    <span id="q-category-badge" class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Concentración Molar</span>
                    <span id="q-solute-badge" class="bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-200/60 text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full">NaCl</span>
                    <button onclick="nextProblem()" class="text-xs font-bold text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-800 bg-indigo-50 hover:bg-indigo-100 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl transition flex items-center gap-1 ml-1">
                        <span>🔄</span> <span id="lbl-new-problem">Cambiar problema</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Enunciado del problema -->
            <div class="bg-slate-50/90 border border-slate-200/80 rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6 mb-6">
                <p id="q-statement" class="text-slate-800 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-medium"></p>
                <div id="q-atomic-masses" class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200/70 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- ================================================= -->
            <!-- ZONA EXCLUSIVA MODALIDAD GUIADA (PASO A PASO)     -->
            <!-- ================================================= -->
            <div id="guided-workspace" class="hidden space-y-5 mb-6">
                <!-- FASE 1: Pregunta de estrategia inicial -->
                <div id="guided-step1-box" class="bg-indigo-50/50 border border-indigo-200/80 rounded-2xl p-5 animate-pop">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                        <span class="bg-[#4f46e5] text-white text-[11px] font-extrabold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full uppercase">Paso 1 de 3</span>
                        <h4 id="lbl-guided-s1-title" class="text-sm font-extrabold text-[#1e1b4b]">Estrategia inicial: ¿Cómo empezamos a plantear el problema?</h4>
                    </div>
                    <p id="guided-s1-question" class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 mb-3"></p>
                    <div id="guided-s1-options" class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-2.5"></div>
                    <div id="guided-s1-feedback" class="hidden mt-3 text-xs font-bold px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl"></div>
                </div>

                <!-- FASE 2: Constructor interactivo de Factores de Conversión con tachado visual -->
                <div id="guided-step2-box" class="hidden bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-5 animate-pop">
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-3">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <span class="bg-[#4f46e5] text-white text-[11px] font-extrabold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full uppercase">Paso 2 de 3</span>
                            <h4 id="lbl-guided-s2-title" class="text-sm font-extrabold text-[#1e1b4b]">Construye la cadena de factores y tacha unidades</h4>
                        </div>
                        <button onclick="resetFactorChain()" class="text-xs font-bold text-rose-600 hover:text-rose-800 bg-rose-50 hover:bg-rose-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg transition">
                            ↺ Reiniciar factores
                        </button>
                    </div>
                    <p id="lbl-guided-s2-desc" class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-3">
                        Haz clic en las tarjetas de abajo en el orden adecuado para cancelar las unidades del numerador con las del denominador hasta obtener las unidades finales buscadas:
                    </p>

                    <!-- Pizarra de ecuación de factores con cancelación visual -->
                    <div class="bg-white border-2 border-indigo-100 rounded-2xl p-4 min-h-[92px] flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 overflow-x-auto shadow-inner" id="factor-chain-board">
                        <!-- Renderizado dinámico del dato inicial y factores añadidos -->
                    </div>

                    <!-- Mensaje de estado de unidades -->
                    <div id="factor-chain-status" class="mt-2.5 text-xs font-bold text-slate-600 flex items-center justify-between"></div>

                    <!-- Banco de tarjetas de factores (correctos + distractores invertidos) -->
                    <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200/80">
                        <div class="text-[11px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 mb-2" id="lbl-factor-bank">Tarjetas de factores disponibles (elige cuál encaja para tachar la unidad anterior):</div>
                        <div id="factor-cards-pool" class="flex flex-wrap gap-2.5"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- ================================================= -->
            <!-- ZONA DE RESPUESTA NUMÉRICA (COMÚN / PASO 3)       -->
            <!-- ================================================= -->
            <div id="numeric-answer-section" class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-4 items-end">
                <div class="md:col-span-6">
                    <label id="lbl-your-answer" for="user-answer" class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
                        TU RESULTADO NUMÉRICO:
                    </label>
                    <div class="relative flex items-center">
                        <input id="user-answer" type="number" step="any" placeholder="Ej: 1.25" 
                               onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter') handleEnterKey()"
                               class="w-full border-2 border-slate-200 focus:border-[#4f46e5] rounded-2xl px-4 py-3 text-lg font-mono-num font-bold text-slate-900 focus:outline-none transition bg-white pr-28">
                        <span id="q-unit-label" class="absolute right-4 text-xs font-extrabold text-indigo-600 bg-indigo-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border border-indigo-100">
                            mol/L (M)
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <p id="lbl-tolerance-note" class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1.5">
                        * Puedes usar punto o coma decimal. Se admite un margen de redondeo del ±3%.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="md:col-span-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2.5">
                    <button id="btn-check" onclick="checkAnswer()" class="flex-1 bg-[#4f46e5] hover:bg-[#4338ca] text-white font-bold py-3.5 px-6 rounded-2xl shadow-md shadow-indigo-200 transition text-sm flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                        <span>✓</span> <span id="lbl-btn-check">Comprobar respuesta</span>
                    </button>
                    <button id="btn-hint" onclick="toggleHint()" class="bg-amber-50 hover:bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 border border-amber-200 font-bold py-3.5 px-4 rounded-2xl transition text-sm flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5">
                        <span>💡</span> <span id="lbl-btn-hint">Pista</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Pista Desplegable (Solo en modo Ejercicio Completo) -->
            <div id="hint-box" class="hidden mt-4 bg-amber-50/90 border border-amber-200 rounded-2xl p-4 text-amber-900 text-sm">
                <div class="font-bold mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                    <span>🧭</span> <span id="lbl-hint-title">Pista para plantear el ejercicio:</span>
                </div>
                <p id="hint-content" class="text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed"></p>
            </div>

            <!-- Feedback y Resolución Paso a Paso con Factores de Conversión -->
            <div id="feedback-box" class="hidden mt-6 rounded-2xl border p-5 sm:p-6 animate-pop">
                <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-4">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
                        <span id="fb-icon" class="text-2xl"></span>
                        <div>
                            <h3 id="fb-title" class="font-extrabold text-base sm:text-lg"></h3>
                            <p id="fb-subtitle" class="text-xs font-medium opacity-85"></p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <button onclick="nextProblem()" class="bg-[#1e1b4b] hover:bg-slate-800 text-white text-xs font-bold px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl transition flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-sm">
                        <span id="lbl-next-btn">Siguiente ejercicio</span> <span>➔</span>
                    </button>
                </div>

                <!-- Resolución con Factores de Conversión -->
                <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200/90 p-4 sm:p-5 mt-3 space-y-3">
                    <div class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider text-indigo-700 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                        <span>📐</span> <span id="lbl-solution-header">Resolución oficial mediante factores de conversión (BAT_FQ 2.1):</span>
                    </div>
                    <div id="fb-steps" class="space-y-3 text-slate-800 text-sm leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ===================================================== -->
        <!-- SECTION B: SIMULADOR INTERACTIVO DE MATRAZ AFORADO    -->
        <!-- ===================================================== -->
        <section id="sec-lab" class="hidden bg-white rounded-3xl pill-shadow border border-slate-100 p-6 sm:p-8 animate-pop">
            <div class="mb-6">
                <h2 id="lab-title" class="text-xl font-extrabold text-[#1e1b4b]">Laboratorio Virtual: Matraz Aforado y Concentración</h2>
                <p id="lab-desc" class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">
                    En un matraz aforado real la disolución se enrasa siempre hasta la línea de aforo del cuello. Observa cómo al elegir un matraz de mayor volumen aumenta el tamaño del recipiente, mientras que al aumentar la concentración el color de la disolución se vuelve más oscuro.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
